# ------------------------------------------------------------------ 7 listening, speaking, glossary
_L81 = [("A", "Cynthia, congrats ha? Dinig ko pumasa ’yung bunso mo sa entrance exam sa UP.", "Cynthia, congrats, okay? I heard your youngest passed the entrance exam at UP."), ("B", "Oo, Tess. Mahirap daw ang exam, sabi niya. Marami silang kumuha pero kokonti ang pumasa.", "Yes, Tess. The exam was hard, he said. Many of them took it but few passed."), ("A", "Matalino naman ang anak mo, nagtapos ’ata siya sa Pisay. O, libre ka na ng matrikula n’yan.", "Your child is smart, he graduated from Pisay, I think. Oh, you are free of tuition now."), ("B", "Hindi lang matrikula. Iskolar din siya ng barangay kaya meron siyang buwanang allowance na dalawang libo.", "Not just tuition. He is also a barangay scholar so he has a monthly allowance of two thousand.")]
